  "solution": {
    "text": "$\\int_0^{\\pi / 4} \\tan ^n x\\left(1+\\tan ^2 x\\right) d x=\\int_0^{\\pi / 4} \\tan ^n x \\sec ^2 x d x=\\int_0^1 t^n d t$ where $t=\\tan x$\n$I_n+I_{n+2}=\\frac{1}{n+1} ; \\Rightarrow \\operatorname{Lim}_{x \\rightarrow \\infty} n\\left[l_n+I_{n+2}\\right]=\\operatorname{Lim}_{x \\rightarrow \\infty} n \\cdot \\frac{1}{n+1}=\\frac{n}{n+1}=\\frac{n}{n\\left(1+\\frac{1}{n}\\right)}=1$",
